	(text "USER UART: CP2102N (self-powered from 3V3_PERIPH) on the User USB-C data lines (ESD on the Power Input\nsheet). VBUS sense from VBUS_USER through 22.1k/47.5k. TXD/RXD to P4 UART1 (GPIO22/21).\nGPIO.0/GPIO.1 = TX/RX activity LEDs (default CP2102N configuration). The UART is only live when the board is on."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 25.4 233.68 0)
